WEBVTT

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:02.990
Show yourself, Leon!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.040
<b><u>Reborn</u></b>

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.040
<b>to Master the Blade
\h\h\h\h\hFrom Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire\h\h\h\h\h</b>

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.040
<b>to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire</b>

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:42.030
<b>Episode 3   Setting Out for the Capital</b>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.450
Yo.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.420
<i>Is that an Artifact?</i>

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.950
Do you mean to betray us?

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:47.380
Something like that, yes.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:54.330
When you said you'd lick a Highlander's 
boots if you had to, that wasn't a joke?

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:54.330
<i>Is he planning to stop us from hurting Rahl 
as a way to win the Highlander's favor?</i>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.480
Don't be stupid. Of course it was a joke.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.800
I'm a holy knight, you know.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.850
I'm ready to throw away my life 
for the people of this nation.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.520
You saw what happened, right?

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.010
Right now, the Highlanders can do

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:12.250
whatever they want, and no one 
on the surface can stop them.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.160
It's a holy knight's duty 
to protect the people, right?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.740
But I can't do shit. And it makes me sick.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.960
But without the Highland's help,

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.450
we can't protect the surface nations 
from the magicite beasts!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.800
There's some things 
we just have to accept...

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.910
I don't like that.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.660
I don't want either the Highlanders or the 
magicite beasts hurting innocent people.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.120
And there's a way to stop them?

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.450
Ever heard of the Bloodchain Brigade?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:40.090
No.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:43.110
An anti-Highland guerrilla organization.

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:46.750
In other countries, Highlanders 
have destroyed entire towns

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.800
after the Brigade killed 
one of their number.

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:51.530
All they do is spread chaos!

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:54.510
You're only seeing one side of the story.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.080
The real goal of the Bloodchain Brigade

00:02:57.080 --> 00:03:02.230
is to turn their blood to chains of iron 
and drag the Highland down to earth.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.920
So you'll defeat the Highlanders,

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:07.870
steal their technology, and spread 
it among the people on the surface?

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.120
You're a smart one.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.670
That way, we can keep ourselves safe 
from the magicite beasts

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.210
without needing to suck up 
to the Highlanders to do it.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.080
The ideal outcome, don't you think?

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.620
And that's why you decided to betray us?

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.180
They've been trying to 
recruit me for a while,

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.550
and what happened tonight 
was the push I needed.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.050
You can't fight the Highland and win!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.520
And that's why I wanted 
to bring you with me.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.510
If they can get a Hyral Menas to research,

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:37.940
they might be able to discover how to make 
Artifacts without the Highlanders' help.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:38.860
No.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.660
I refuse to take part in something that will 
lead countless people to their deaths!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.930
Want to come with me, Inglis?

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.420
I must decline.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.320
So you're like Eris? You want 
to keep things as they are?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:56.540
Nope! But the way I see it, if I side with 
Eris, I might get a chance to fight you!

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.250
S-She's crazy...

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.300
I can understand what you're saying.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.780
But I've stopped connecting 
power with justice.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.210
<i>I've lived one life that way already.</i>

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:15.200
If you want to take Eris, come and get her!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.370
I saw enough of that last fight 
to tell you're strong.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.400
It's hard to believe a cute little girl 
can be so tough.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:26.350
As an adult, I should go easy on you, 
but I'll give you all I've got!

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:28.780
Be careful!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.240
That's a high-rank Artifact that Leon's got!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:35.740
It has a gift that allows it 
to command lightning beasts!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.920
<i>By my eye, about thirty.</i>

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.160
Two of you, follow me.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.380
The rest, go get Inglis.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.090
<i>Eris is injured.</i>

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:53.050
<i>He means to stall me, and then spirit 
her away while I am thus occupied.</i>

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.790
<i>A shrewd stratagem!</i>

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:02.650
If you hit them with a strong attack, 
they'll explode!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.760
You sliced it in half? From that distance?

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.490
Next time we fight, use that skill!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.590
No!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.460
I'm not like you! 
I don't fight because I enjoy it!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.530
You can't fire that one off 
that often, can you?

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:20.810
You used it just to tell 
Inglis to be careful, huh?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:22.870
That was nice of you.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.650
So you're a tsundere, huh?

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.800
Shut up!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.090
Oh, I hadn't realized!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.560
Hang on! I'll come help you!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.630
Idiot! I just said...

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.940
Wh-What happened?

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:57.070
What's going on?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.590
I figured it out, Eris!

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.770
If you can't dodge their 
explosions at close range,

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.960
then you just need to boost 
your defense so much...

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:10.640
that the explosions don't hurt you, right?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.600
I was trying to tell you 
to attack from a distance!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.610
This is faster, though!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:20.390
<i>I can surround myself with waves of 
compressed aether—an Aether Shell—</i>

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:23.770
<i>to absorb the blast wave from the explosions!</i>

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.990
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:33.110
You're dreadful.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:37.340
How could you tell me to use my full strength
when you weren't using yours?

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.960
That's not true.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:43.170
<i>The flaw in this technique is that 
it can't be maintained for long.</i>

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.700
You're incredible, kid.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:50.480
I don't think either Eris or I 
could handle you alone.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.640
Which means you're a monster 
on par with a Prismer.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:59.330
Yes! I'm training to get to the point 
where I can defeat one on my own!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.660
Are you serious?

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.570
It's good to dream big!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.000
Maybe you'll be invincible in the future,

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.110
but for now, I'm just going to 
hope that you've got a weakness.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:13.570
For example, you can't keep that little 
trick of yours up for long, can you?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:17.560
<i>He's sharp. And strong of conviction.</i>

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.330
<i>In my previous life, he would have 
been one of my most trusted men.</i>

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.540
And if that's true?

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.080
What else? We see who breaks first!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:30.470
Not happening.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:32.070
Seriously?

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:36.400
It's not nice to stare at a girl's legs.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.220
You're the one shoving them in my face!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.100
I said, not happening!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.530
Rani!

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.800
A magicite beast!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.630
Rani!

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.640
<i>I won't let her be harmed!</i>

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.500
<i>I will protect Rani, no matter what!</i>

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:24.570
<i>To master the blade, I decided to 
live this life beholden to none...</i>

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:28.270
<i>But this is the one promise I made to myself!</i>

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.740
<i>My vow as "Inglis Eucus"!</i>

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.190
Rani, are you okay?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.590
Thank you, Chris!

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:44.420
What are you doing here?

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:48.870
It wouldn't be right to make you 
do this all by yourself!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:53.100
So I was going to go on ahead 
and teach Rahl a lesson myself.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.300
But when I was inside, waiting,

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.700
he suddenly started to scream in pain, 
and then he turned into that thing...

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.550
<i>That's Rahl?</i>

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:06.600
Inglis!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.930
<i>That's my name...</i>

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.990
But how?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.710
I've never heard of a human 
becoming a magicite beast!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.180
I drugged him.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.380
Leon!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.190
What do you mean?

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.160
It's called Prism Powder.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:25.630
A drug made of condensed 
Prism Flow, they said.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.280
The Bloodchain Brigade created it.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:31.110
They gave me some last time 
they tried to recruit me.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:34.240
It's harmless to surface people, 
but if you use it on a Highlander...

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.100
Well, you can see for yourselves.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.270
There's no way to cure him?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:39.980
Of course not.

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:42.820
He deserves a miserable death, in any case.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:46.920
Anyway, I'll be going.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:50.730
Between you and Inglis, he's no threat.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.200
Explode!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.400
He got away.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.480
What's going on?

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.970
Why is Leon...

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.590
I'll explain later.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:08.540
Inglis!

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:12.270
<i>It may be what he deserves, but I still 
feel pity seeing him in this state.</i>

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.240
I'll at least put you down 
without making you suffer!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.120
Chris!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:21.340
<i>There's only one way 
to end this in a single strike.</i>

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:26.130
<i>But if were to do that here, 
it would raze not only the mansion</i>

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.770
<i>but also a large chunk of the town.</i>

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:31.040
<i>Is there a means by which 
the townsfolk may be spared?</i>

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:39.520
<i>That's it!</i>

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.780
Rafinha! Inglis!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.800
Are you all right?

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:47.160
Father! You came!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.640
I'm sorry! I was wrong!

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.380
I should never have left the two of you 
to shoulder this on your own!

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:58.530
Inglis!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:57.950
A magicite beast?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.510
Don't let it leave the grounds!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.600
Split up!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.810
Wait!

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.900
Eris is going to help us!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.370
Eris!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.270
What are you planning on doing?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.720
Follow my lead!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.440
We'll kick it!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.910
Inglis!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.380
I-It landed all the way out of the city.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.550
Way to go, Eris!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:38.490
You're so powerful!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:39.840
What are you saying?

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:42.800
I'm not strong enough to kick it that far.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:47.280
Follow. My. Lead.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.730
Now, let's finish this!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.800
Inglis!

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.520
It's still standing.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:02.120
What was that you just did?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.380
You made it look like I was 
the one who kicked it...

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:08.100
Chris doesn't want people 
knowing about her power.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:12.080
If people knew there was somebody who could 
defeat a magicite beast without a Rune,

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.950
it would cause chaos, she says.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.300
I see.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.460
<i>That's the excuse I gave her,</i>

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:21.380
<i>but the truth is, I just don't want to be 
stuck with the duty of protecting the town!</i>

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.850
So, what do we do?

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.350
Eris, is that magicite beast 
as strong as a Prismer?

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:28.610
No.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:32.790
It's strong, I think, but it's like the 
difference between an adult and a child.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:37.270
So I need to be able to defeat it in 
one hit if I want to fight a Prismer.

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:41.430
Chris!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:41.430
What are you doing?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.180
Just watch!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.870
Inglis!

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.790
What is that power she's using?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.550
<i>It's been twelve years since then...</i>

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:03.730
<i>This is the perfect chance to test the power 
I've spent this whole time training!</i>

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.730
Inglis!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.920
Rahl... Goodbye.

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:14.900
Aether...

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.350
Strike!

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:34.870
W-Wow!

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:36.910
That's my Chris!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.540
Chris!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.690
You okay?

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:47.410
I'm a little tired, I think.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.550
I don't have enough stamina. 
Gotta train more.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.640
You're crazy...

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.920
What you said was right, Rani.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:56.820
What did I say?

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:00.270
If you make a wish upon the Highland, 
it'll come true.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:04.450
Today's fight was a pretty good one.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.250
I'll tell everyone that 
this was Leon's doing,

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.400
and that he betrayed us 
for the Bloodchain Brigade.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:14.360
I'll make sure nobody blames you or Ymir.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.390
Please do!

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:20.790
And tell everyone that it was you 
who defeated the magicite beast, too.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:24.970
Well, if that's what you want, but...

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:25.580
But?

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.540
You owe me one.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.290
Repay that debt someday.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.620
Okay, got it!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.460
Goodbye.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:35.690
Um, may I ask something?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.860
What is it?

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:42.450
When we were introduced at the party, 
you seemed upset about something.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.050
Why was that?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.620
Sorry.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:52.070
You may find out someday, 
but I don't want to say it.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.530
I don't want people finding out 
if I can help it.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.910
Here I go, Chris!

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.320
Okay, Rani!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:18.100
<b>Rafinha   Age 15</b>

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.960
Wow!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.110
I doubled the number of arrows, too!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:21.960
Yeah! Your bow's getting 
stronger and stronger!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:23.310
<b>Inglis   Age 15</b>

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.320
It's worth dodging!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:25.390
What does "worth dodging" mean?

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:28.280
Oh, it's time to go!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.390
No way! I'm not packed!

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:34.710
<i>On this day, 15-year-old Inglis and 
Rafinha would set out for the capital.</i>

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:33.190
Rani, you silly girl.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:39.910
<i>They were to enroll in the knights' 
academy in the capital city of Kyral.</i>

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:43.150
Take good care of Rafinha.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:44.640
I will, Your Grace!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:48.070
If any boys go after her, drive them off!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.560
Leave it to me!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:59.720
<i>Rafinha would train to be a knight, 
and Inglis, to be her squire.</i>

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:04.070
<i>They would leave behind the home 
they'd known for their whole lives,</i>

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.330
<i>and take the month-long 
journey to the capital.</i>

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:10.110
<b>Town of Nova</b>

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.810
The ruler of this town is a Highlander?

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:18.020
Yup. They just took over last year.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.130
And they haven't done 
anything terrible, right?

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.710
Not at all!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:26.450
If anything, life's better 
than it was under our last ruler.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:29.480
All the townspeople are grateful.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.150
I see...

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:36.490
I guess not all Highlanders are bad.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.510
Yeah.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.390
Traveling is so fun!

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.030
There's so much good food everywhere!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:43.900
Yup.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.870
But if we don't cut back a little, 
we're going to run low on funds.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:52.590
Huh? But it's only been ten days 
since we left Ymir!

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:56.010
This is because you eat so much, Chris.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:59.970
You too! You eat enough 
for four people every meal!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:04.740
But without money, we can't 
eat yummy food on our trip!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:09.100
Why not go help at the castle?

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.350
The castle?

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:16.710
Our ruler is hiring knights and mercenaries 
to help with magicite beast attacks.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.670
You two are both knights, 
or so it seems to me.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.240
They're hiring mercenaries, huh?

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.860
Sounds like a job for us!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:29.110
This feels so good!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.320
The hiring exam was easy, huh?

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.320
Sure was.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:39.460
We just had to fight a few knights.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:42.420
They're giving us the good guest rooms, too!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.860
And the bath is huge!

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.360
What's wrong?

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.080
No, it's nothing.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:53.040
<i>Something has been bothering me 
ever since I arrived.</i>

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.570
<i>The flow of mana seems strange.</i>

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:01.330
<i>It's like a small amount of mana is being 
drawn away from beneath everyone's feet.</i>

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.270
<i>Like it's being drained...</i>

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.910
Chris, I'll wash your back!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:08.690
O-Okay!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.410
You're so lucky, Chris.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.350
You have big breasts, and they're so pretty!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:17.820
And a nice round butt, too!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:21.570
Don't say that... It's embarrassing.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:25.530
I've got the body of a little girl. 
So I'm jealous!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:27.350
It's not fair.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.990
They're so big and soft!

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:33.730
I wish mine were like that!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.440
Let me go!

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:36.210
You look like you're having fun.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.520
Good evening.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.400
G-Good evening.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:43.590
What's wrong?

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:45.890
You're a Highlander?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:49.980
Yes. I'm sorry for not 
introducing myself earlier.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.620
I'm the magistrate of Nova, Seilyn.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.660
"Magistrate"? You're the town's ruler!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.140
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:59.950
So this bath is for the ruler?!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.330
We didn't know...

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.020
It's fine.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.470
I heard that a knight with a Greater Rune

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:10.470
and another warrior had arrived, 
so I wanted to meet them.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.250
Lady Seilyn!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.190
We want to take a bath too!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.060
Rino! Miyumi! Chiko!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:20.700
You know better than to interrupt 
our ruler when she's talking!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.480
It's alright, Mimoza.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:23.930
Come in, girls!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.700
Okay!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:27.140
Me first!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.040
No, me!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.150
Wait!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.760
Those kids...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.730
I know it must be hard for you.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:38.110
Not at all. I only have a son of my own, 
so it's nice to have little girls around.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.560
Those girls...

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.170
They're orphans. I couldn't just 
leave them on the streets.

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:47.950
Wow, that's wonderful!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.070
That's how a true ruler should be!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:51.350
Thank you.

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:54.360
Um, I have a question.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.310
Go ahead.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:59.350
The flow of mana in this city
seems strange, somehow.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.990
Is there a reason for that?

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.060
I'm sorry. I don't know anything about that.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.260
I see.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:09.610
<i>If there's some powerful warrior 
underground draining everyone's power,</i>

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.790
<i>I hope I get to fight them!</i>

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:14.740
How long will you be staying?

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:17.470
We can't stay that long.

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:20.620
We'll be enrolling in the knights' academy 
in the capital.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.190
I see.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.740
Is that a problem?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.090
There's something I'd like your help with.

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:29.160
Just say the word!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.660
If there's something we can help with...

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:38.490
Even if it involves fighting not 
magicite beasts but people?

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:43.360
The knights who served under the 
old ruler were a wicked bunch,

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:46.590
and I fired them all a little while ago.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:50.740
Their violence toward the 
townspeople had become a problem.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:57.030
They've all joined together, 
and they seem to be planning something.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:01.440
Some of the knights I send out 
on patrol have been attacked.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.200
I want to deal with them all at once,

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.170
before something happens to 
endanger the townspeople.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.650
I know where their hideout is.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.490
Chris...

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:14.620
There's one hundred, at a minimum.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:16.410
There he is!

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:22.410
I knew if I caused enough trouble 
in town, you'd come eventually.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.690
Welcome.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:25.590
Hawker, the last knight commander.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.760
He's the leader.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:34.180
You can't possibly beat this many, 
Miss High-and-Mighty Highlander.

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.130
Quality over quantity!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:38.960
Chris, preemptive attack!

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.350
Don't kill them, okay, Rani?

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:43.120
I'll just blow them all away!

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:47.670
Wh-What? A Greater Artifact?

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:48.860
Burst!

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:54.680
Sorry. I'm going to have to take you down.

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:00.950
Lament your own poor fortune 
that I happened to be here today.

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:08.110
<i>This intensity... It's just like Eris!</i>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.880
<i>She's a Hyral Menas!</i>

